            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devuelve la tupla de <code>age</code> seguida de <code>can_drive</code> y omite los paréntesis.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"check_age\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  can_drive = age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age, can_drive\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"67\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>age, can_drive</code>.</p></body></html>"
